;: iobin.lca (3042PC84-70), hand-written: I/O block inputs
Version 2
Design 3042PC84 9 0
Speed -70
Editblk CB
Base FG
Config X:F Y:G F:A G:B DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A
Equate G = B
Endblk
Editblk KC
Base FG
Config X:F Y:G F:A:C G:B DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A*C
Equate G = B
Endblk
Editblk HH
Base FG
Config X:F Y: F:A:B G: DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A@B
Endblk
Editblk P13
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P57
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P14
Base IO
Config IN:IQ:FF OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P15
Base IO
Config IN:IQ:LATCH:IKNOT OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P36
Base IO
Config IN:IQ:FF:IKNOT OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P37
Base IO
Config IN:I:PULLUP OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P38
Base IO
Config IN:IQ:LATCH OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P45
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P46
Base IO
Config IN:PULLUP OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P2
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P3
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P4
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P5
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Addnet GPAD TCLKIN.I GCLK.I
Addnet APAD BCLKIN.I ACLK.I
Addnet GK GCLK.O P14.IK P15.IK
Addnet AK ACLK.O P36.IK P38.IK
Addnet Q14 P14.Q CB.A
Addnet Q15 P15.Q CB.B
Addnet Q36 P36.Q KC.A
Addnet I37 P37.I KC.C
Addnet I38 P38.Q KC.B
Addnet O0 CB.X P2.O
Addnet O1 CB.Y P3.O
Addnet O2 KC.X P4.O
Addnet O3 KC.Y P5.O
